      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I see that it is even simpler to reproduce this error:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Start an empty fedora</li>\n\t<li>Create a container \n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>curl -i -XPUT localhost:8686/f4/rest/test</li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Version the container\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>curl -i -XPOST -H\"slug: v0\" localhost:8686/f4/rest/test/fcr:versions</li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Export the repository\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li>java -jar target/fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -m export -b -d data -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a> -V\n\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t<li>BOOM!</li>\n\t\t</ol>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ol>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
     "created": "26/May/17 8:37 PM",
