  "description": "<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>1. fire up fcrep4: </p>\n\n<p>java -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61717 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61713 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8686 --headless --contextPath /f4</p>\n\n<p>2.  Create a container and add a binary.  (test/binary1)</p>\n\n<p>3. create a version  (v1)</p>\n\n<p>4.  create a second version (v2)</p>\n\n<p>5.  Do an export:  <br/>\n(commit 7f0d76)<br/>\njava -jar target/fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d ~/import-export-sprint-3/data-export-versioned-binaries  -a -m export  -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a> -b -V</p>\n\n<p>6.  Verify that the importer outputs the following error: </p>\n\n<p>ERROR 15:17:27.170 (ImportExportDriver) Error performing import/export: Export operation failed: unexpected status 500 for <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest/fcr:versions\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest/fcr:versions</a></p>\n\n<p>Fcrepo4 puts out the following: </p>\n\n<p>ERROR 15:17:27.165 (WildcardExceptionMapper) Exception intercepted by WildcardExceptionMapper: 1</p>",
